hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1758","Narrated from Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (may Allah be pleased with him) that a man came to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) and said, ""O Prophet of Allah! How will the disbelievers be gathered on their faces in Hell on the Day of Resurrection?"" The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) replied: ""The One who made them walk on their feet in the world, is He not able to make them walk on their faces on the Day of Resurrection?"" (Al-Furqan: 34)"
